@anon.53fe85e3a453dfbf0ab1e8743506e67c.1347 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [413 x i8] }> <{ [413 x i8] c"Shifts the operand's bits to the right by the specified amount.\0APerforms an arithmetic shift by default (extends the sign bit to the left,\0Asuch that negative numbers stay negative), but that can be changed by the\0A`logical` parameter.\0A\0AFor the purposes of this function, the operand is treated as a signed\0Ainteger of 64 bits.\0A\0A```example\0A#64.bit-rshift(2)\0A#(-8).bit-rshift(2)\0A#(-8).bit-rshift(2, logical: true)\0A```" }>, align 1
